# Contact form (optional). Without this, the form falls back to opening the
# visitor's mail client with a prefilled draft to gordonyli@gmail.com.
#
# To send silently in the background instead:
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter gordonyli@gmail.com
#   2. Copy the Access Key they email you
#   3. Create a file named `.env` next to this one with:
#        VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-access-key-here
#   4. Restart `npm run dev`
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
